## Realistic Livestock

**FS25_ForwardContracts requires Realistic Livestock (the Ritter version,
`FS25_RealisticLivestockRM`) and does not function without it.**

Realistic Livestock is the work of its own authors and is licensed separately under the GNU
General Public License v3. This repository contains **no** Realistic Livestock code or data.
Forward Contracts reads Realistic Livestock's live objects and published data at run time
and ships none of it.

Used with the kind permission of Ritter. Full credit for Realistic Livestock, its genetics
model, its breeding simulation and its animal data belongs to its authors — Forward
Contracts is built on top of that work and would not exist without it.

Realistic Livestock: https://github.com/rittermod/FS25_RealisticLivestockRM

